Significance: minor
Type: changed

The supported Action Scheduler floor is 4.2.0. A site whose elected Action Scheduler is below that runs on WP-Cron instead, and its scheduling diagnostics report a dormant scheduling backend. Action Scheduler elects the highest version among every bundled copy on the site, and a copy bundled by another plugin, such as WooCommerce, can be older than the floor, so install or update the standalone Action Scheduler plugin. Upgrade Action Scheduler before upgrading this plugin: until the elected copy reaches 4.2.0, background work is delivered by WP-Cron on a best-effort basis, a recurring chain the older copy holds keeps delivering beside its WP-Cron replacement (one run per occurrence is still admitted), each successful schedule synchronization a consumer plugin runs logs a warning, and hook-wide clearance is refused. The next synchronization after the upgrade removes the surplus chain.
